[[File:GNN Detective Pikachu.png|thumb|280px|A depiction of the building occupying the GNN headquarters from [[Detective Pikachu Ryme City Guide]]]]
'''GNN''' (Japanese: '''{{j|GNN}}''' ''GNN'') is a popular local television station headquartered in [[Ryme City]] in the game {{OBP|Detective Pikachu|video game}}. Most of Chapter 6 takes place here.

The company's president is [[Ethan Graham]]. [[Emilia Christie]], [[Meiko Okamoto]], [[Keith Norman]] and [[Roger Clifford]] work as a news reporter, a camerawoman, an assistant director, and a producer for GNN, respectively.

